# The native projects, generated rather than kept.
#
# `expo prebuild` writes `android/` and `ios/` from `app.json` every time it runs — the Gradle
# files, the Xcode project, the Podfile, the icons, the permission strings. Committing them means
# maintaining two descriptions of the same app and finding out they disagree at release time, so
# CI generates them on the runner and they exist locally only while somebody is building.
#
# Note what this makes `app.json`: the only description of the phone app there is. A change there
# is a change to both native projects, and nothing in the repository will contradict it.
/android
/ios

